      "uid": "zhcn:207e554c67043a3b6f4194c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比如摩托车跟大型巴士。\n以同样速度过弯时，\n比较重的巴士会更受到强大离心力影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb9b9b1c5ec9b66ec4fc4237edbabd131f08b55581dfb4cc2c3c16572ebc7d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
