      "uid": "zhcn:7a31dc3a50b06f16cd095447",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "质量越大离心力就越大。\n如果要抑制离心力，\n会给身体带来很大的负担。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2265c1fe81d7d1e5afa02e025c73979c19261211c59fe10db60441709a0d164e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
